    "kicker": "Self-Forgiveness and Renewal",
    "h1": "Forgiving Yourself After a Bad Campus Relationship",
    "lede": "The lingering shame of staying too long with someone who disrespected you, losing your hard-earned grades, or becoming the subject of hostel gossip can feel paralyzing. Here is how to forgive yourself, shed the burden of regret, and reclaim your university crown.",
    "date": "2026-09-27",
    "ctaHeading": "Start Fresh with High-Value Campus Singles",
